      "side": 1,
      "message": "As noted in the other file, I think creating a shim will be cleaner in the short term.\n\nThis file can simply have:\n#ifndef CONFIG_ZEPHYR\nstatic inline void chipset_exit_hard_off(void) { }\n#endif\n\nThe shim code should include the CONFIG_AP_PWRSEQ check:\n\nvoid chipset_exit_hard_off(void)\n{\n    if (!IS_ENABLED(CONFIG_AP_PWRSEQ))\n        return;\n    /* Call into Zephyr AP power sequence code */",
